  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You receive a string `s`. You can convert `s` to a palindrome by adding characters in front of it.\n\nOutput *the shortest palindrome you can find by performing this transformation*.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"aacecaaa\"\nOutput: \"aaacecaaa\"\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"abcd\"\nOutput: \"dcbabcd\"\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `0 <= s.length <= 5 * 104`\n* `s` is composed of lowercase English letters only.",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
